	(text "STARTUP: rails settle -> ESP32 boots (SDZ low, MUTE high, XSMT low).\nConfigure PCM5122 at 0x4C with both channels muted; configure DSP and valid 64fs I2S.\nEnable SDZ, wait >=50 ms, release DAC mute, then amplifier mute; ramp DAC volume.\nSHUTDOWN: ramp down, assert DAC XSMT low >=150/fs +0.2 ms; assert MUTE then SDZ low.\nFAULT: mute and shut down, log fault; deliberate retry only after fault cause is removed.\nReview report and bench validation are required before connecting the real drivers."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.02 187.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0d47ab0c-8b69-4e62-9eab-464ceb73eab6")
	)
	(text "ACTIVE SPEAKER - ESP32-WROVER / PCM5122 / TPA3126D2"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.46 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a3df961b-bdc2-44c6-9385-a30a6a6bdd27")
	)
	(text "12-16 V DC -> protected PVDD -> stereo BTL amplifier.\nPVDD -> 4.30 V FPWM buck -> ESP32 3.3 V LDO + DAC 3.3 V low-noise LDO.\nPCM5122 LEFT = woofer / CH1; RIGHT = tweeter / CH2. Both speaker returns are active.\nExternal Nichicon UES capacitor on J18; replace with shorting link for stereo use.\nNo passive crossover. DSP crossover/EQ/limiting remains a firmware and acoustic task."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.46 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b340fd54-c046-4b8c-9a39-f96146a7a45d")
	)
